{"seq":3,"slug":"slot-proposal-booking-conflict","title":"时段推荐与预约防冲突：候选求解、tentative 占位与并发资源预订","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/calendar-scheduling-icalendar-rrule-caldav-availability/freebusy-availability-scheduling/slot-proposal-booking-conflict","wordCount":3437,"readingTime":14,"html":"<h1 id=\"时段推荐与预约防冲突-候选求解-tentative-占位与并发资源预订\">时段推荐与预约防冲突：候选求解、tentative 占位与并发资源预订</h1><p>上一篇把「哪些区间空着」算成了一条流水线，产出一组规范化空闲区间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span>。但从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 到一个落地的会议，中间还隔着两件独立的事：<strong>求解</strong>——在连续可行域里挑出该展示的起点并排序；<strong>提交</strong>——在多个组织者可能同时抢同一间会议室、同一个人的同一段时间时，保证不会双重预订。前者是启发式排序问题，没有唯一答案；后者是并发控制问题，必须有确定性的仲裁点。把两者混为一谈，就会出现「推荐看着最好，点下去报 412」或者更糟的「两个人都以为抢到了」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-候选-占位-确认是三个独立阶段\">核心概念：候选、占位、确认是三个独立阶段</h2><p>三个阶段各有权威来源与失效模式，混用它们会同时损失体验与正确性：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>候选（proposal）</strong>——纯启发式，读的是某一刻的忙闲快照，快照过期即作废，<strong>不构成任何承诺</strong>，任何时候可重算。</li>\n<li><strong>占位（hold）</strong>——有 TTL 的临时保留，不写日历、不发通知，只影响并发求解器的输入。</li>\n<li><strong>确认（commit）</strong>——唯一产生外部副作用的一步：写事件、发 iTIP 消息、占用真实资源。必须经过唯一原子仲裁点，且必须幂等。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三者的关系单向：候选 → 占位 → 确认。反过来做（先确认再校验）失去防冲突的意义；跳过占位直接确认，则会在用户思考的窗口期被并发组织者抢占。</p>\n<h2 id=\"候选求解-从连续可行域到可展示的离散起点\">候选求解：从连续可行域到可展示的离散起点</h2><p>空闲区间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[f_i, f_{i+1})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 内满足时长与缓冲的可行起点是一个<strong>连续区间</strong>（取值规则见 <a href=\"availability-interval-algebra\">可用性计算</a>）。用户消费不了连续域，第一步是粒度对齐：以<strong>当事用户本地时区</strong>的整点为基准，向上取到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 的整数倍（常见 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g=15</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span></span></span></span></span> 分钟）。这一步看似平凡，却是「推荐差 45 分钟」类 bug 的高发区——在 +05:45 的 <code>Asia/Kathmandu</code> 用 UTC 整点对齐，槽位会落在 :47 这种从不出现在 UI 网格里的分钟上。</p>\n<p>离散之后要排序，必须引入显式打分函数，否则实现会退化成「按时间先后取前 N 个」，把「周三下午全员有空且紧邻上个会议」的好时段排到周五清晨的孤立空档后面。一个够用的线性打分是</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>g</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>gap</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>edge</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score}(s) = w_c \\cdot C(s) + w_f \\cdot F(s) - w_g \\cdot \\text{gap}(s) - w_e \\cdot \\text{edge}(s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7306em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7306em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">gap</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5945em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">edge</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 是出席确定性、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 是「落在偏好时段内」的指示、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>gap</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{gap}(s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">gap</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是该槽位与相邻已占用块的间隔（越小越紧凑，减少日历碎片）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>edge</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{edge}(s)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">edge</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 惩罚贴着工作时间边界的时段（会议超时会溢出）。权重是产品参数而非自然常数，必须可配置并写入推荐日志，否则「为什么推这个时段」无法回答。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 的取值有一份来自真实 API 的现成语义可对齐：Microsoft Graph 的 <code>findMeetingTimes</code> 对每个参会人按忙闲状态折算出席概率——<strong>空闲记 100%、状态未知记 49%、忙记 0%</strong>，会议整体的 <code>confidence</code> 是这些概率的算术平均：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1.00</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>0.49</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>0.00</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = \\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{i=1}^{n} p_i, \\qquad p_i \\in \\{1.00,\\ 0.49,\\ 0.00\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1.00</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.49</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.00</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>3 名参会人分别为「空闲 / 未知 / 忙」时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.49</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>49.7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = (1 + 0.49 + 0)/3 \\approx 49.7\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.49</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">49.7%</span></span></span></span></span>，低于默认阈值 50% 就不会被返回。这条规则的价值在于把「未知」定义成<strong>弱正信号</strong>而非零：49% 让未答复的邀请不至于把时段判死，又不与确定空闲等价。求解器还必须有<strong>收窄产出量</strong>的参数——Graph 用 <code>maxCandidates</code> 限制候选数，并用 <code>emptySuggestionsReason</code> 解释为何无解（时间窗太窄、参会人过多、时长超过任一段空闲）。没有后者的 API 会强迫客户端猜测。实现上，求解即「空闲集合中长度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mtext>pre</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>b</mi><mtext>post</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge d + b_{\\text{pre}} + b_{\\text{post}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pre</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">post</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的区间的起点集合」，双指针一次扫描，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(|F|)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"tentative-占位-把-软预订-做成有-ttl-的一等资源\">tentative 占位：把「软预订」做成有 TTL 的一等资源</h2><p>从「推荐了 3 个时段」到用户点选，中间可能隔几分钟到几小时，而这期间别人也在看同一段。直接下发 <code>STATUS:CONFIRMED</code> 会在用户反悔时产生一堆撤消邮件；完全不占位则让并发组织者互相覆盖。但 iCalendar 里 <code>TENTATIVE</code> 有<strong>两层互不相同的含义</strong>，混淆会写出语义错误的系统：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>事件的持久状态</strong>：<code>VEVENT</code> 的 <code>STATUS:TENTATIVE</code>（RFC 5545 §3.8.1.11），表示组织者尚未定论。它对忙闲的贡献是 <code>BUSY-TENTATIVE</code>——上一篇讲过，这是可被查询方单列的<strong>软冲突</strong>类型。</li>\n<li><strong>参会人的答复状态</strong>：<code>ATTENDEE;PARTSTAT=TENTATIVE</code>（RFC 5546 §3.2.3），表示被邀请人「暂定出席」。这是答复语义，不改变事件本身在日历里的占用。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>工程上的占位对象应当<strong>独立于事件</strong>：一张 <code>slot_hold</code> 记录，主键覆盖 <code>(resource_id, time_range)</code>，字段含 <code>holder</code>、<code>expires_at</code>（TTL 通常 5–15 分钟）、<code>state ∈ {HELD, CONFIRMED, RELEASED}</code>。占位不写任何人的日历、不触发 iTIP 消息，因此可随意创建与回收；它唯一的作用是在求解器的忙集合里注入一条<strong>临时忙区间</strong>，让并发组织者的候选看不到它。TTL 过期由后台任务回收，而不是靠请求方删——否则崩溃的客户端会永久锁死时段。</p>\n<p>CalDAV 侧有更规范化的对应机制：<code>VFREEBUSY</code> 请求通过 <code>POST</code> 发到组织者自己的 <strong>scheduling Outbox</strong>，<code>ORGANIZER</code> 必须与 Outbox 所有者一致（RFC 6638 §5）。服务端返回以 <code>CALDAV:schedule-response</code> 为根的 XML，每个收件人一个 <code>CALDAV:response</code>，内含 <code>CALDAV:recipient</code>、<code>CALDAV:request-status</code> 与承载忙闲数据的 <code>CALDAV:calendar-data</code>（§10.1–10.4）。这条路径的价值是<strong>不暴露事件明细</strong>：组织者只拿到合并后的忙区间，看不到对方的 <code>SUMMARY</code>。忙闲访问本身受权限约束——目标 Inbox 上需 <code>CALDAV:schedule-query-freebusy</code>，请求方 Outbox 上需 <code>CALDAV:schedule-send-freebusy</code>（§6.1.4、§6.2.4）；某日历是否算「忙」还受 <code>CALDAV:schedule-calendar-transp</code> 控制（§9.1）。把这些权限位建进模型，而不是写 <code>if (isColleague)</code>，是忙闲查询可审计的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"并发预订-仲裁点必须唯一\">并发预订：仲裁点必须唯一</h2><p>推荐的时段是<strong>建议</strong>，不是<strong>承诺</strong>。两名组织者同一秒点同一间会议室，服务端必须有唯一仲裁点决出胜负。可选机制不止一种，强度与代价差别很大，混用还容易产生「两层锁语义不一致」的漏洞。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>载体</th>\n<th>冲突时的行为</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>schedule-tag</code> + <code>If-Schedule-Tag-Match</code></td>\n<td>CalDAV 响应头</td>\n<td><code>412 Precondition Failed</code></td>\n<td>服务端隐式调度下的调度对象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ETag</code> + <code>If-Match</code></td>\n<td>通用 HTTP 资源</td>\n<td><code>412 Precondition Failed</code></td>\n<td>普通日历对象的更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>EXCLUDE USING gist</code></td>\n<td>PostgreSQL 约束</td>\n<td>违反排除约束，事务回滚</td>\n<td>会议室/设备等唯一资源占位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>UNIQUE (resource_id, slot_key)</code></td>\n<td>数据库唯一索引</td>\n<td><code>23505 unique_violation</code></td>\n<td>固定网格槽位（半小时间隔）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分布式锁（Redis/etcd）</td>\n<td>应用层</td>\n<td>获取失败，退避重试</td>\n<td>跨服务、短临界区的多步编排</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>CalDAV 的 <code>schedule-tag</code> 值得单独说，因为它的语义比普通 <code>ETag</code> 更贴调度场景（RFC 6638 §3.2.10、§8.2、§8.3）。服务端在响应里返回 <code>Schedule-Tag</code> 头，客户端后续用 <code>If-Schedule-Tag-Match</code> 提交；tag 在<strong>无意义的服务端更新</strong>上保持不变——例如某位参会人的答复只改了自己的 <code>PARTSTAT</code>——于是另一个客户端的编辑可以被<strong>合并</strong>而不是被拒绝，只有在客户端直接编辑或组织者实质性改期（<code>DTSTART</code>/<code>DTEND</code>/<code>DURATION</code>/<code>RRULE</code> 等，§3.2.8）时才变更。tag 不匹配时 <code>PUT</code> 返回 <code>412</code>（§3.2.10.1），<code>DELETE</code>/<code>COPY</code>/<code>MOVE</code> 亦然（§3.2.10.2）；匹配时服务端把其他参会人的改动并入存储对象。RFC 明确建议调度更新<strong>优先用这个头而不是 ETag</strong>——用 ETag 会把「别人答复了邀请」误判成冲突，让组织者频繁看到假 412。</p>\n<p>数据库层的排他约束是最硬的仲裁。PostgreSQL 用 <code>btree_gist</code> 扩展配合 GiST 排除约束，把一个标量列（资源 ID）与一个范围列（时间段）的重叠同时纳入一条约束：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE EXTENSION IF NOT EXISTS btree_gist;&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE room_hold (&#10;    id       bigint GENERATED ALWAYS AS IDENTITY PRIMARY KEY,&#10;    room_id  integer   NOT NULL,&#10;    booked   tstzrange NOT NULL,&#10;    state    text      NOT NULL,&#10;    CONSTRAINT room_hold_no_overlap&#10;        EXCLUDE USING gist (room_id WITH =, booked WITH &amp;&amp;)&#10;        WHERE (state &lt;&gt; &#39;RELEASED&#39;)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> EXTENSION </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IF</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> EXISTS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> btree_gist;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> room_hold</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">bigint</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> GENERATED</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ALWAYS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IDENTITY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    room_id  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">integer</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    booked   tstzrange </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    text</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    CONSTRAINT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> room_hold_no_overlap</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        EXCLUDE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gist (room_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, booked </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;&#x26;)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'RELEASED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>约束语义是「不存在两行同时满足所有比较」，因此同一 <code>room_id</code> 下任意两行的 <code>booked</code> 不得重叠（<code>&amp;&amp;</code>）。范围默认是<strong>半开</strong>边界 <code>[)</code>，所以 <code>[09:00,10:00)</code> 与 <code>[10:00,11:00)</code> <strong>不算重叠</strong>——这正是背靠背会议能排上、off-by-one 不会误报的根源。<code>WHERE (state &lt;&gt; &#39;RELEASED&#39;)</code> 是部分排除约束：已释放的占位不再参与排他判定。PostgreSQL 也接受 SQL:2011 的时态唯一性写法 <code>UNIQUE (room_id, booked WITHOUT OVERLAPS)</code>，它等价于上面这条排除约束，且同样需要 <code>btree_gist</code> 支持标量列。用数据库约束而非「先查后插」的意义在于：检查与写入在<strong>同一个原子操作</strong>里完成，两个并发事务不可能都通过检查——这是应用层「查一下有没有冲突再写」永远做不到的。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[空闲区间 F] --&gt; B[粒度对齐枚举候选起点]&#10;  B --&gt; C[打分排序&lt;br/&gt;confidence / gap / 边界惩罚]&#10;  C --&gt; D[取前 N 个候选展示]&#10;  D --&gt; E{用户点选}&#10;  E --&gt;|选中| F[创建 slot_hold&lt;br/&gt;TTL 5-15 分钟]&#10;  F --&gt; G{数据库排他约束}&#10;  G --&gt;|23505 冲突| H[提示已占用&lt;br/&gt;候选顺延重算]&#10;  G --&gt;|插入成功| I[POST Outbox VFREEBUSY&lt;br/&gt;复查参会人仍空闲]&#10;  I --&gt; J{参会人答复}&#10;  J --&gt;|接受| K[转 CONFIRMED&lt;br/&gt;释放 TTL]&#10;  J --&gt;|拒绝或超时| L[回滚占位&lt;br/&gt;候选顺延]\">flowchart TD\n  A[空闲区间 F] --&gt; B[粒度对齐枚举候选起点]\n  B --&gt; C[打分排序&lt;br/&gt;confidence / gap / 边界惩罚]\n  C --&gt; D[取前 N 个候选展示]\n  D --&gt; E{用户点选}\n  E --&gt;|选中| F[创建 slot_hold&lt;br/&gt;TTL 5-15 分钟]\n  F --&gt; G{数据库排他约束}\n  G --&gt;|23505 冲突| H[提示已占用&lt;br/&gt;候选顺延重算]\n  G --&gt;|插入成功| I[POST Outbox VFREEBUSY&lt;br/&gt;复查参会人仍空闲]\n  I --&gt; J{参会人答复}\n  J --&gt;|接受| K[转 CONFIRMED&lt;br/&gt;释放 TTL]\n  J --&gt;|拒绝或超时| L[回滚占位&lt;br/&gt;候选顺延]</pre><h2 id=\"幂等与回滚-超时不等于没发生\">幂等与回滚：超时不等于没发生</h2><p>占位与确认之间的网络调用跨越服务端、客户端与邮件系统，任何一跳都可能超时，而<strong>超时不代表对方没执行</strong>：一次 <code>POST</code> 发出后客户端断线，服务端可能已把邀请投递出去。因此写路径必须幂等——占位与确认都以客户端生成的幂等键（如邀请的 <code>UID</code> + 目标时段哈希）为唯一标识，重试命中已有记录时返回同一结果而非创建第二条。iTIP 的 <code>UID</code> 天然适合承担这个角色：同一 <code>UID</code> 的 <code>REQUEST</code> 重复投递应被识别为重发而非新邀请，这与 RFC 6638 §3.2.4 的一组前置条件（<code>CALDAV:unique-scheduling-object-resource</code> 等）相呼应。</p>\n<p>回滚路径同样要显式设计。占位在 TTL 内未确认时由回收任务标记 <code>RELEASED</code>，并把该时段从求解器的临时忙集合移除；若占位已转 <code>CONFIRMED</code> 又被取消，那不是「回滚」而是<strong>新事件</strong>——需要走 iTIP 的 <code>CANCEL</code> 而不是删除记录，因为对方日历里已落地了一份。区分这两种操作，是避免「幽灵会议」的关键：数据库里干净，别人日历里还挂着。</p>\n<p>还有一类必须早做的语义决定：<strong>部分出席</strong>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 只有 60% 时，是允许预约并标注「部分参会人冲突」，还是直接判为不可行？这不是算法问题而是产品契约，必须在 API 里用显式参数表达（Graph 用 <code>minimumAttendeePercentage</code>，默认 50%，可设 100 要求全员空闲），而不是硬编码在求解器里。做成参数后，同一套求解逻辑就能同时服务「必须全员到齐的评审会」与「可缺席的例会」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨境电商排期语境下的额外约束\">跨境电商排期语境下的额外约束</h2><p>这套机制放进跨境团队会遇到几条普通排期系统不常碰到的硬约束。<strong>一是时区跨度</strong>：一个运营团队可能同时覆盖 UTC+8、UTC+1 与 UTC-8，跨时区候选急剧稀疏，求解器必须按每个参会人的<strong>本地</strong>工作窗口分别求交（见 <a href=\"availability-interval-algebra\">可用性计算</a> 的逐日展开纪律），而不是用一个统一 UTC 窗口。<strong>二是角色语义</strong>：iTIP 的 <code>ROLE</code>（<code>REQ-PARTICIPANT</code> / <code>OPT-PARTICIPANT</code> / <code>NON-PARTICIPANT</code>）与 <code>RSVP</code> 决定谁必须回、谁只是抄送；把 <code>OPT-PARTICIPANT</code> 也算进 <code>minimumAttendeePercentage</code> 的分母，会让所有会议都难以排上。<strong>三是资源类型</strong>：仓库收货时段、物流提货窗口这类对外承诺不是「可选时段」而是<strong>容量受限的槽位</strong>，天然适合唯一索引而非区间排除约束建模，且同一月台可允许多个预约而会议室不行——把「资源容量」建成一等字段，而非散落在业务代码里，是同一套预订服务同时服务两类对象的前提。</p>\n<h2 id=\"交叉验收-排序与并发两侧的典型故障\">交叉验收：排序与并发两侧的典型故障</h2><p>这些失守点大多只在并发或跨时区时暴露，常规单线程用例捕获不到，可作上线前的检查清单。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>推荐与提交用了不同的忙集合</strong>——求解用某一刻快照，提交时不复查，推荐时段在点选时已被占。根因是缺少提交前的 <code>VFREEBUSY</code> 复查或占位注入。</li>\n<li><strong><code>schedule-tag</code> 与 <code>ETag</code> 混用</strong>——用 <code>ETag</code> 做调度更新，别人只是答复了邀请就返回 412。根因是仲裁点选错协议头。</li>\n<li><strong>漏建 <code>btree_gist</code> 后静默失去排他</strong>——迁移时扩展创建失败却被忽略，<code>EXCLUDE</code> 未生效。根因是约束创建没有断言。</li>\n<li><strong><code>RELEASED</code> 的行仍参与排他</strong>——忘记 <code>WHERE</code> 子句，被释放的占位永久挡住时段；或 TTL 靠客户端删除，崩溃后时段死锁。</li>\n<li><strong>半开边界当闭区间</strong>——背靠背会议被误判冲突，或相邻时段出现非法重叠。</li>\n<li><strong>confidence 把未知当零</strong>——未答复的邀请让所有会议都排不上。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>从候选到确认是一条三段链，每段有独立正确性标准。<strong>候选求解</strong>把连续可行域按本地时区粒度离散，用显式打分函数排序，并用对齐 Graph 语义的出席概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1.00</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0.49</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0.00</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i \\in \\{1.00, 0.49, 0.00\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1.00</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.49</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.00</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span> 计算 <code>confidence</code>，同时保留 <code>maxCandidates</code> 与 <code>emptySuggestionsReason</code> 这类可解释接口。<strong>tentative 占位</strong>是有 TTL、独立于事件表的一等资源，靠注入临时忙区间影响并发求解，并通过 CalDAV Outbox 的 <code>VFREEBUSY</code>（RFC 6638 §5）在不暴露明细的前提下复查参会人可用性。<strong>并发预订</strong>的唯一仲裁点应选在数据库——<code>EXCLUDE USING gist (room_id WITH =, booked WITH &amp;&amp;)</code> 把检查与写入原子化，比任何「先查后插」都可靠；CalDAV 场景则用 <code>schedule-tag</code> + <code>If-Schedule-Tag-Match</code> 而非 <code>ETag</code>，因为只有前者能区分「别人答复」与「真实改期」。最后两件事必须早定：写路径的幂等键（用 iTIP 的 <code>UID</code>），以及取消与回滚的区别——取消是发给对方的新事件，回滚是自己数据的清理，两者不可互相替代。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"时段推荐与预约防冲突：候选求解、tentative 占位与并发资源预订","id":"时段推荐与预约防冲突-候选求解-tentative-占位与并发资源预订"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：候选、占位、确认是三个独立阶段","id":"核心概念-候选-占位-确认是三个独立阶段"},{"level":2,"text":"候选求解：从连续可行域到可展示的离散起点","id":"候选求解-从连续可行域到可展示的离散起点"},{"level":2,"text":"tentative 占位：把「软预订」做成有 TTL 的一等资源","id":"tentative-占位-把-软预订-做成有-ttl-的一等资源"},{"level":2,"text":"并发预订：仲裁点必须唯一","id":"并发预订-仲裁点必须唯一"},{"level":2,"text":"幂等与回滚：超时不等于没发生","id":"幂等与回滚-超时不等于没发生"},{"level":2,"text":"跨境电商排期语境下的额外约束","id":"跨境电商排期语境下的额外约束"},{"level":2,"text":"交叉验收：排序与并发两侧的典型故障","id":"交叉验收-排序与并发两侧的典型故障"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"可用性计算：时区归一、区间合并与工作时间/缓冲窗口代数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/calendar-scheduling-icalendar-rrule-caldav-availability/freebusy-availability-scheduling/availability-interval-algebra"},"next":{"title":"CalDAV 协议与资源模型：日历集合、WebDAV REPORT 与 ETag 条件请求","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/calendar-scheduling-icalendar-rrule-caldav-availability/caldav-invitations-scale-integration/caldav-protocol-resource-model"}}